<%# locals: (code:) %>
<p>
  Or enter this code on the page where you asked for this email:
  <b data-sign-in-code="true" style="font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 2px; white-space: nowrap"><%= code.first(3) %> <%= code.last(3) %></b>
  <br>
  <span style="color: #555">The code expires in <%= Patron::SIGN_IN_CODE_EXPIRE.in_minutes.to_i %> minutes.</span>
</p>
